{'symbol': 'TRGP', 'date': '2019-11-06 22:30:00', 'title': 'TARGA RESOURCES CORP. REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019', 'text': 'TARGA RESOURCES CORP. ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. FOR THE THIRD QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 1,902.5 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 2,986.4 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 41.6 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 76.7 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET LOSS WAS USD 47.3 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 23.7 MILLION A YEAR AGO. FOR THE NINE MONTHS, TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 6,197.2 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 7,886.3 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 216.6 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 318.2 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET LOSS WAS USD 96.4 MILLION COMPARED TO NET INCOME OF USD 108.2 MILLION A YEAR AGO.'}